      "path": "src/ui/backup/other-tabs.ts",
      "content": "The query/reply exchange is asynchronous, but awaiting file preparation does not guarantee that another tab's reply has arrived. If preparation finishes before a delayed/background tab processes the query (or before its reply is delivered), `unsavedElsewhere()` is still false and the preview permanently omits A133; a later reply does not update this returned preview. Synchronize with a bounded reply-collection phase (or keep the preview warning subscribed to subsequent replies) rather than using preparation duration as the response window. Add a test where the unsaved reply arrives after preparation resolves; the current test sets the flag synchronously inside the facade double and cannot expose this race.",
